{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】題目：簡樸房義務調解服務</p><p>簡樸房制度涉及不同持份者，過程中或出現分歧，相關機構獲房屋局支持推出義務調解服務，可應用在甚麼場景？調解過程是怎樣？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>一邦國際網上仲調中心主席蘇紹聰</p><p>地產代理監管局行政總裁梁松泰</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:00:04.378673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T18:18:02.307203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:36.090817+00:00","content_hash":"bd37fb6a8680517569874d33ad4f900783d6045eca8beeb578beb27b6cd21a3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}